        <a href="/electrical-repairs" class="intent-card">
          <p class="intent-kicker">Something isn't working?</p>
          <h3>Electrical Repairs &amp; Troubleshooting</h3>
          <p>Dead outlets, tripping breakers, flickering lights — we find the root cause and fix it right.</p>
          <span class="intent-go" aria-hidden="true">Start here →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/panel-upgrades" class="intent-card">
