          <p>Level 2 chargers, hot tubs, workshops, appliances — dedicated circuits done to code.</p>
          <p class="intent-links">
            <a href="/ev-chargers">EV charger →</a>
            <a href="/dedicated-circuits">Hot tub, workshop, appliance →</a>
