        </div>
        <a href="/commercial" class="intent-card">
          <p class="intent-kicker">Business or facility?</p>
          <h3>Commercial Electrical</h3>
          <p>Three-phase, buildouts, controls, maintenance — from service calls to 9,600 sq ft additions.</p>
          <span class="intent-go" aria-hidden="true">Start here →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <h3 class="all-services-heading">All Services</h3>
