        </a>
        <a href="/electrical-design-consultation" class="service-card">
          <h3>Electrical Design Consultation</h3>
          <p>Pre-construction planning and load layout for new builds and remodels.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/commercial-led-lighting-retrofit" class="service-card">
          <h3>Commercial LED Retrofit</h3>
          <p>Efficient lighting upgrades for businesses with better light quality.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/commercial-electrical-maintenance" class="service-card">
          <h3>Commercial Electrical Maintenance</h3>
          <p>Scheduled maintenance that keeps commercial systems running.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="section-more">
        <a href="/services">See all West Michigan electrical services →</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="container gallery-section" id="gallery">
