        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center mt-6">
        <a href="/about" class="btn btn-ghost">Meet the Owner</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="reviews-preview">
      <h2>Recent Customer Feedback</h2>
      <p>
        Verified Google reviews from West Michigan homeowners and contractors — no pressure, no inflated promises. Read
        all <a href={siteData.seo.googleBusinessProfileUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"
          >{siteData.seo.googleReviewCount}+ reviews on Google</a
        >.
      </p>
      <div class="service-cards">
        <article class="service-card">
          <h3>“By far the best we ever felt with”</h3>
          <p>
            “We've had 5 new builds and 2 remodels — this is by far the best we ever felt with. Very engaged, very
            friendly. You can't find a better person more focused, more in line with your desires on your build. Won't
