      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="process">
      <h2>How Scheduling Works</h2>
      <div class="process-timeline">
        <div class="timeline-step">
          <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Share your project</h4>
            <p>Call, text a photo, or submit the 30-second fast-estimate form.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-step">
          <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Get a clear plan</h4>
            <p>We confirm scope, code considerations, and timeline options.</p>
