        </div>
        <div class="timeline-step">
          <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Approve and schedule</h4>
            <p>Lock in your date and receive written next steps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Need help planning a larger upgrade? We can walk scope and phased options before you schedule.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="blog-spotlight">
      <h2>From the Blog</h2>
      <p>Practical guides from a licensed master electrician on the questions West Michigan homeowners actually ask:</p>
      <ul class="blog-spotlight-list">
        <li>
          <a href="/blog/burning-smell-from-outlet">Burning smell from an outlet: what to do in the next 5 minutes</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/blog/flickering-lights-when-to-worry"
            >Flickering lights: when it's annoying vs when it's an emergency</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/blog/100-amp-vs-200-amp-panel">100 amp vs 200 amp panel: which does your home need?</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/blog/how-to-size-a-whole-home-generator">How to size a whole-home generator for a Michigan home</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/blog/michigan-ev-charger-rebates">Michigan EV charger rebates & utility programs (2026)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/blog/zinsco-fpe-panel-replacement">Zinsco and Federal Pacific panels: why they need to go</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="section-more"><a href="/blog">See all electrical guides →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="areas">
      <h2>Service Areas</h2>
      <p>Based in Allegan, serving homes and businesses across West Michigan:</p>
      <div class="area-chips">
        <a href="/electrician-allegan-mi">Allegan</a>
        <a href="/electrician-grand-rapids-mi">Grand Rapids</a>
        <a href="/electrician-holland-mi">Holland</a>
        <a href="/electrician-zeeland-mi">Zeeland</a>
        <a href="/electrician-saugatuck-mi">Saugatuck</a>
        <a href="/electrician-hudsonville-mi">Hudsonville</a>
        <a href="/electrician-byron-center-mi">Byron Center</a>
        <a href="/electrician-muskegon">Muskegon</a>
        <a href="/electrician-grand-haven">Grand Haven</a>
      </div>
      <p class="section-more"><a href="/service-areas">See all service areas →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="faq">
      <h2>Common Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>Do you handle both residential and light commercial work?</summary>
